# Automatically copied to bin/.env (ignored) if absent. Check against the
# existing installation before starting. No passwords, paths or assignments.
# Format: component selection. Omitted components are not managed.
# Build always builds all five runtime images, not just this selection.
# Start is blocked until the operator checks projects/overlays/profiles and
# explicitly uncomments the acknowledgement. Never copy it blindly.
# ready yes
web base
# reader base
# For SQL use "web history" instead; MQTT file auth: "web auth+history".
# reader auth
# storage base
# rollup on
# https on
# uart gateway
